  record valid (context: basis, references and record ids)
reading points  4
  o2.atom-1     physical-object · class oxygen-atom · scope particular — "oxygen atom 1 of one O₂ molecule"
                record valid · physical unestablished (evidence: 0)
  o2.atom-2     physical-object · class oxygen-atom · scope particular — "oxygen atom 2 of the same O₂ molecule"
